        <mxCell id="master_env" value="CIO Allocator Environment&#10;&#10;State: specialist metrics (returns, vol, Sharpe, drawdown)&#10;       + market regime (VIX, trend, sentiment)&#10;       + portfolio (current weights, value, turnover)&#10;       + correlations (between strategies)&#10;&#10;Action: allocation weights w = [w₁, w₂, ..., w₇]&#10;        s.t. Σwᵢ = 1, wᵢ ∈ [0.05, 0.40]&#10;&#10;Reward: Sharpe ratio - λ₁·turnover + λ₂·diversification" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
