        <mxCell id="master_agent" value="PPO Master Agent&#10;&#10;Policy: π(w|s) = Softmax(μ_θ(s))&#10;&#10;PPO Objective:&#10;$L^{CLIP}(\theta) = \mathbb{E}[\min(r_t(\theta)\hat{A}_t,$&#10;$\text{clip}(r_t(\theta), 1-\epsilon, 1+\epsilon)\hat{A}_t)]$&#10;&#10;Value function: V_φ(s) estimates returns&#10;&#10;Advantage: $\hat{A}_t = \sum_{l=0}^{T-t} (\gamma\lambda)^l \delta_{t+l}$" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
